WEBVTT

00:10.802 --> 00:12.804
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

01:33.093 --> 01:36.429
EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTION
NEAR HANYANG CASTLE

01:46.898 --> 01:48.108
Tomorrow morning,

01:50.777 --> 01:53.196
your families, who were taken
to the Investigation Bureau,

01:54.531 --> 01:56.491
will be beheaded.

02:04.207 --> 02:05.750
Continuing to serve me...

02:07.836 --> 02:09.879
might put all of you in danger.

02:11.464 --> 02:12.507
Will you all...

02:15.426 --> 02:17.512
stay loyal to me nevertheless?

02:39.951 --> 02:41.202
PATIENT JOURNAL

02:55.216 --> 02:56.676
Mom!

02:56.759 --> 02:59.888
Please! Let him go!

02:59.971 --> 03:01.306
Get out of the way!

03:03.141 --> 03:04.726
No! My son!

03:08.062 --> 03:09.397
No!

03:13.318 --> 03:14.194
Father!

03:42.555 --> 03:43.389
Halt.

03:49.062 --> 03:51.522
This country is suffering
one disaster after another.

03:51.606 --> 03:53.775
What happened to Lord Cho Hak-ju
was devastating enough.

03:53.858 --> 03:55.944
How about we postpone the executions?

03:56.027 --> 04:00.114
Her Majesty ordered us to carry out
the executions as planned, no matter what.

04:00.198 --> 04:02.700
The Minister of War has a point.

04:02.867 --> 04:06.246
Some of the soldiers' families
are of noble origin.

04:06.663 --> 04:08.748
It would not be too late
to carry out the executions

04:08.831 --> 04:11.125
after investigating the incident.

04:11.668 --> 04:14.212
It is Her Majesty's order,

04:14.879 --> 04:16.506
which means it is a royal order.

04:16.589 --> 04:18.883
Please come out for a moment.

04:24.597 --> 04:25.807
Military Training Commander.

04:27.100 --> 04:28.643
I am here to make a confession.

04:30.019 --> 04:31.312
The traitor, Chang,

04:32.772 --> 04:34.941
is waiting for backup troops
at Yeonggi Academy...

04:35.525 --> 04:38.653
just outside of Hanyang with soldiers
from the Military Training Corps.

04:40.071 --> 04:41.906
I told you what I know, so please help me.

04:44.117 --> 04:46.452
I beg you to spare my family's lives.

05:02.802 --> 05:05.263
Father was right.

05:09.976 --> 05:11.644
My son, Chang,

05:12.562 --> 05:14.522
dug his own grave.

05:27.785 --> 05:28.619
Shoot!

05:39.589 --> 05:41.299
I do not hear any screams.

05:58.399 --> 05:59.692
There is no one here, sir!

05:59.776 --> 06:01.194
No one here either, sir!

06:06.449 --> 06:09.077
It must have been a trap
to lure the soldiers...

06:09.577 --> 06:10.703
out of Hanyang.

06:12.413 --> 06:14.040
SEO YEONG-GO

06:20.338 --> 06:21.714
LEE CHANG

06:28.221 --> 06:30.390
The Crown Prince is here!

07:04.006 --> 07:07.552
The rest of the soldiers,
seal off the gates!

07:10.680 --> 07:12.974
NORTH GATE, CITADEL OF HANYANG

07:38.791 --> 07:40.251
The Crown Prince is back!

07:40.334 --> 07:41.377
The Crown Prince is here.

07:41.461 --> 07:43.671
How many soldiers do we have left
in the Police Bureau?

07:43.754 --> 07:45.923
Many left the citadel
with the palace guards,

07:46.007 --> 07:47.341
so only a few dozen at the most.

07:47.425 --> 07:48.718
Assemble all of them.

07:48.801 --> 07:51.137
And ask the Minister of War
for backup troops.

07:54.974 --> 07:59.353
ROYAL COMMANDERY

08:14.118 --> 08:15.745
"Dear people of Joseon.

08:16.787 --> 08:19.040
As soldiers
who have pledged their loyalty...

08:19.582 --> 08:22.210
to this country, their duty
was to punish the traitor, Chang.

08:22.293 --> 08:25.087
However, they abandoned their duty
and joined hands with the traitor

08:25.171 --> 08:27.840
in pursuit of their selfish greed.

08:27.924 --> 08:30.968
Thus, all families and relatives
of the treacherous soldiers

08:31.052 --> 08:32.678
shall be executed--"

08:33.471 --> 08:35.139
Please spare us.

08:36.557 --> 08:39.769
But we didn't do anything wrong.

08:45.942 --> 08:47.360
This is a royal order.

08:48.110 --> 08:48.945
Let the beheading...

08:53.991 --> 08:55.535
No, it can't be...

08:57.328 --> 08:58.496
No.

09:03.084 --> 09:04.043
Let the...

09:13.511 --> 09:14.971
I cannot do this.

09:15.721 --> 09:18.099
I do not care if I am the head
of the Royal Commandery or not,

09:18.224 --> 09:19.559
I can't do it.

09:32.822 --> 09:33.823
Your Royal Highness.

09:39.245 --> 09:40.246
Your Royal Highness.

09:43.916 --> 09:45.334
You made the right decision.

09:45.793 --> 09:47.712
Your Royal Highness.

09:47.795 --> 09:48.879
I will...

09:50.214 --> 09:52.508
return to where I rightfully should be.

09:54.427 --> 09:56.137
Will you join hands with me?

09:57.388 --> 10:00.850
The Royal Commandery Division
will be at Your Royal Highness' service.

10:07.565 --> 10:09.108
Untie them.

10:10.234 --> 10:11.319
They are not criminals!

10:19.910 --> 10:21.037
Give me a sword.

10:22.204 --> 10:23.873
I, too, will go to the palace.

10:34.133 --> 10:35.259
My lord.

10:35.718 --> 10:37.511
The traitors were sent
to the execution site.

10:39.680 --> 10:41.807
My lord, why are you being like this?

10:41.891 --> 10:43.851
- Tie them up!
- Yes, my lord!

10:51.067 --> 10:53.736
JINSEON GATE

10:53.819 --> 10:54.945
What do you mean?

10:55.029 --> 10:57.406
The traitor, Chang,
is headed to the palace?

10:57.490 --> 10:59.742
What were the soldiers doing?

10:59.825 --> 11:02.453
Even Royal Commandery
and the Minister of War's soldiers

11:02.536 --> 11:04.330
have joined hands with the traitors.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.335
The gates have been sealed off,

11:09.418 --> 11:11.921
so even the palace guards
cannot enter the citadel.

11:16.342 --> 11:17.301
Your Majesty.

11:17.802 --> 11:19.679
You must escape immediately.

11:27.311 --> 11:29.063
I will go to the Main Hall.

11:30.189 --> 11:31.524
I should get ready...

11:32.942 --> 11:34.151
to welcome my son.

11:35.611 --> 11:36.779
Your Majesty...

12:02.972 --> 12:04.974
PATIENT JOURNAL

12:05.057 --> 12:06.559
How is this possible?

12:06.642 --> 12:09.562
That patient journal was recorded
by Lee Seung-hui,

12:09.645 --> 12:10.813
the former royal physician.

12:10.896 --> 12:13.399
Everything recorded in it is true.

12:15.693 --> 12:18.904
What would His Royal Highness
like me to do?

12:19.572 --> 12:22.116
His Royal Highness would like you
to prove...

12:23.993 --> 12:27.496
that you are different from
the Haewon Cho Clan and their followers.

12:40.009 --> 12:43.429
We have successfully subdued the soldiers
from the entire Police Bureau.

12:44.221 --> 12:46.474
Now, we will escort Your Royal Highness
to the palace.

12:54.940 --> 12:57.026
His Royal Highness
left for the palace first.

13:02.656 --> 13:04.074
What do you mean?

13:09.622 --> 13:11.749
Is His Royal Highness back?

13:12.792 --> 13:13.626
Let him out.

13:20.800 --> 13:24.303
The world ruled by the Haewon Cho Clan
has come to an end.

13:40.736 --> 13:42.613
Your Royal Highness!

13:42.696 --> 13:44.949
Please spare our lives.

13:45.783 --> 13:48.577
All we did was obey the orders

13:48.661 --> 13:52.665
of Lord Cho Hak-ju and Her Majesty.

13:53.082 --> 13:56.669
Please have mercy, Your Royal Highness.

13:58.337 --> 14:02.174
We will faithfully serve
Your Royal Highness from now on.

14:02.258 --> 14:06.178
We have already disarmed
the palace guards at all the gates.

14:07.346 --> 14:08.722
Please feel free to enter.

14:53.434 --> 14:54.768
You are back.

14:57.062 --> 14:58.689
Have you been away for so long

14:58.772 --> 15:01.317
that you forgot how to pay
your respects to your mother?

15:03.027 --> 15:04.778
You are not my mother.

15:10.075 --> 15:11.994
You still do not know
your filial duties...

15:12.745 --> 15:14.038
toward your mother.

15:15.164 --> 15:16.415
Step down from the throne.

15:17.124 --> 15:19.043
The throne does not belong to you.

15:19.460 --> 15:23.172
Do you think you can make the people
of this kingdom serve you by doing this?

15:25.257 --> 15:26.258
You are wrong.

15:27.384 --> 15:28.385
Son,

15:29.178 --> 15:30.721
you are a criminal of high treason

15:30.804 --> 15:32.806
who decapitated his father
with his own hands.

15:34.642 --> 15:36.060
Now, the throne...

15:38.562 --> 15:40.564
belongs to my child,
who is the deceased king's son.

15:45.194 --> 15:46.403
Is that child...

15:47.613 --> 15:50.199
truly the deceased king's son?

15:50.282 --> 15:53.494
Why is it that pregnant women
were gathered at Naeseonjae?

15:53.577 --> 15:54.495
Also,

15:55.496 --> 15:58.457
why did Your Majesty kill
those pregnant women and baby girls?

15:59.583 --> 16:01.669
The Minister of War is right.

16:02.211 --> 16:04.755
I, too, have been doubting it
for quite some time.

16:05.172 --> 16:08.926
We must arrest the royal physicians
and Your Majesty's court ladies

16:09.009 --> 16:10.678
to find out the truth.

16:10.761 --> 16:15.349
How dare you doubt
the legitimacy of my child!

16:15.432 --> 16:17.643
The reason I am trying to oust you

16:17.726 --> 16:21.313
is not because you are a Haewon Cho,
nor is it because I desire the throne.

16:21.939 --> 16:24.942
You've neglected the responsibilities
and duties that come with the throne.

16:25.275 --> 16:27.194
"The people worship food like God,

16:27.277 --> 16:30.990
and the King must serve
those people like God."

16:32.408 --> 16:34.493
That is why I am trying to oust you.

16:42.251 --> 16:43.335
Now, make your decision.

16:48.007 --> 16:49.967
Will you step down of your own accord?

16:50.884 --> 16:53.595
Or will you be dragged down
from the throne like a dog?

16:54.638 --> 16:57.016
Was beheading your own father
not enough for you?

16:57.433 --> 17:00.894
Will you even kill your mother
and brother now?

17:04.523 --> 17:05.941
Go ahead and try.

17:07.568 --> 17:09.194
I am not leaving the throne.

17:09.987 --> 17:12.865
I will not even budge.

17:17.828 --> 17:20.789
It is unnecessary to dirty
Your Royal Highness' hands with blood.

17:20.873 --> 17:21.832
Do not be concerned.

17:21.915 --> 17:23.876
I will bring the seal and make her issue

17:23.959 --> 17:25.878
a royal edict to announce
your enthronement.

17:28.505 --> 17:30.007
I will go with him.

17:50.944 --> 17:52.905
The Second and Third State Councillors

17:52.988 --> 17:54.782
are on their way here
to get the royal seal.

19:12.317 --> 19:13.902
Is anyone inside?

19:17.197 --> 19:19.283
Don't walk so fast.

21:15.691 --> 21:18.026
Second State Councillor,
what about the royal seal?

21:18.110 --> 21:20.237
Second State Councillor! It's me!

21:21.113 --> 21:22.322
Stay away from me!

21:25.909 --> 21:27.160
Stay away!

21:27.953 --> 21:29.746
Stay away, I said!

21:32.833 --> 21:34.793
Let go of me!

21:47.931 --> 21:49.558
Help! Over here!

21:51.852 --> 21:54.354
Over here! Help me!

22:22.841 --> 22:23.884
What on earth...

22:25.010 --> 22:26.887
have you been plotting?

22:28.889 --> 22:30.557
If I cannot have it,

22:34.311 --> 22:35.687
no one else...

22:37.481 --> 22:38.982
can have it.

22:57.667 --> 22:59.002
The plague has broken out!

23:00.545 --> 23:01.880
The plague has broken out.

23:08.095 --> 23:09.930
The plague has broken out!

23:15.560 --> 23:18.939
The plague has broken out
from the Queen's Palace.

23:27.614 --> 23:30.200
Lock up all the gates at the palace!

23:32.661 --> 23:35.038
HEUNGHWA GATE

23:35.122 --> 23:36.790
SUNGJEONG GATE

23:37.582 --> 23:39.418
What is happening?

23:39.835 --> 23:42.879
- How could the plague break out here?
- That is not important now.

23:42.963 --> 23:44.256
We do not have time.

23:45.757 --> 23:49.010
Be they noblemen or high-ranking officers,

23:49.094 --> 23:50.971
aim for their heads,
regardless of their rank.

23:51.054 --> 23:54.641
We must kill every single person
who has caught the plague!

23:54.724 --> 23:56.476
- Do you understand?
- Yes, Your Royal Highness!

23:57.936 --> 23:59.062
Your Royal Highness.

24:31.928 --> 24:32.929
Do not be afraid!

25:34.658 --> 25:36.910
Go hide somewhere safe. Hurry!

25:42.749 --> 25:44.209
It's occupied.

25:49.714 --> 25:50.715
Jeez.

25:51.341 --> 25:52.968
Someone's in here.

27:44.079 --> 27:45.705
YEONGYEONG GATE

27:54.464 --> 27:56.049
Take the portraits of the former kings.

29:10.999 --> 29:12.000
Do you think...

29:12.792 --> 29:13.668
we killed them all?

29:21.968 --> 29:23.428
The screams...

29:24.804 --> 29:26.264
I no longer hear any screams.

29:30.685 --> 29:31.561
What is happening?

29:33.688 --> 29:35.815
Has it been brought under control?

29:59.714 --> 30:02.425
Your Royal Highness must escape!

30:02.509 --> 30:06.054
Please escape at once!

30:18.608 --> 30:21.194
- There are too many of them.
- Your Royal Highness, we must run.

30:24.531 --> 30:25.740
Hurry, Your Royal Highness!
